 "summary": "The Vaisala RM60 is a compact radar precipitation sensor that reports rain intensity, accumulation, snow and precipitation type, plus air pressure when that measurement option is ordered. On RS-485 it serves Modbus RTU (or a text data message). This map covers the measurement floats, drop-size distribution, reset and interval settings, serial settings, status and diagnostic registers, device monitoring and the test registers.",
 "transport": [
  "RTU"
 ],
